# BusinessIntelligence.ai — Prototype Implementation Plan (v2)

## What We're Building

A working KPI intelligence-to-action engine that connects to **live Supabase PostgreSQL** (6 tables, ~300K rows of real Olist data), runs **deterministic statistical analysis** to detect anomalies, auto-generates and tests causal hypotheses using graph traversal + algebra (no LLM), then uses **Gemini** only for narrative polish. The frontend shows a **diagnostic tree** where each failing KPI branches into ranked causes, each with evidence, confidence scores, and contribution percentages. New data can be uploaded via CSV to demo live analysis.

